## **📚 Key Tone.js References**

- **AmplitudeEnvelope**: `new Tone.AmplitudeEnvelope({ attack, decay, sustain, release })`
- **Filter**: `new Tone.Filter({ frequency, type, Q })`
- **Reverb**: `new Tone.Reverb({ roomSize, dampening, wet })`
- **Delay**: `new Tone.FeedbackDelay(delayTime, feedback)`
- **Distortion**: `new Tone.Distortion(distortion)`
- **Compressor**: `new Tone.Compressor(threshold, ratio)`
- **EQ3**: `new Tone.EQ3(low, mid, high)`

